参与者说明：






























角色职责Unity/C# 对应Director（指挥者）定义构建步骤的顺序和流程，不关心具体实现关卡配置脚本、角色创建流程控制器IBuilder（生成器接口）声明各步骤的抽象方法C# interface，常与 ScriptableObject 配合CharacterBuilder（具体生成器）实现各步骤，逐步组装产品纯 C# 类或持有 SO 配置的构建器Character（产品）最终构建结果，不关心自己是怎么被组装的游戏实体、配置对象、ScriptableObject 实例



                  Director 不是必须的 



流畅接口（Fluent Builder）模式中，客户端直接链式调用 Builder 方法，不需要 Director。Director 的价值在于”复用构建流程”——如果多个地方需要相同的构建步骤顺序，Director 才有意义。


工作原理
public class Character
{
    public string Race { get; set; }
    public string Class { get; set; }
    public string Weapon { get; set; }
    public int Hp { get; set; }

    public override string ToString() =&gt; $&quot;{Race} {Class} with {Weapon}, HP={Hp}&quot;;
}

public class CharacterBuilder
{
    private readonly Character _character = new();

    public CharacterBuilder WithRace(string race)
    {
        _character.Race = race;
        return this;
    }

    public CharacterBuilder WithClass(string cls)
    {
        _character.Class = cls;
        return this;
    }

    public CharacterBuilder WithWeapon(string weapon)
    {
        _character.Weapon = weapon;
        return this;
    }

    public CharacterBuilder WithHp(int hp)
    {
        _character.Hp = hp;
        return this;
    }

    public Character Build() =&gt; _character;
}

// 使用
var hero = new CharacterBuilder()
    .WithRace(&quot;Elf&quot;)
    .WithClass(&quot;Archer&quot;)
    .WithWeapon(&quot;Longbow&quot;)
    .WithHp(120)
    .Build();
带 Director 的版本——复用构建流程：
public class CharacterDirector
{
    // 预设流程：弓手
    public Character BuildArcher(CharacterBuilder builder, string race)
    {
        return builder
            .WithRace(race)
            .WithClass(&quot;Archer&quot;)
            .WithWeapon(&quot;Longbow&quot;)
            .WithHp(100)
            .Build();
    }

    // 预设流程：战士
    public Character BuildWarrior(CharacterBuilder builder, string race)
    {
        return builder
            .WithRace(race)
            .WithClass(&quot;Warrior&quot;)
            .WithWeapon(&quot;Sword&quot;)
            .WithHp(200)
            .Build();
